          "_key": "gh954yl3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Creators want fast video concepts without losing the soul of an idea — the kind of speedy drafts that let you try three directions before breakfast. Enter Dreamina: an all-in-one AI creative suite living on the CapCut/Bytedance family of sites that promises text→image→video convenience inside a friendly web UI. In this review I’ll walk through first impressions, show real hands-on tests with exact prompts, explain how Dreamina can fit into a real pipeline, and give a clear verdict on who should use it (and when to pass)."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
