        {
          "_key": "59la0328",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Signup & UI:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2jvh0ym0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Signing in (or trying a demo) is quick and the UI is clean — bright cards for templates, clear calls of \""
        },
        {
          "_key": "qt9norhg",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "AI image, AI video, AI avatar, Mimic Motion"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5nkfflxc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\" and an obvious prompt box. Starter templates and categories (e.g., marketing, avatars, posters) are front-and-center, which helps you skip the blank-canvas dread."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nx00ac57",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "q26hhvdr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Learning curve:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "sae1vke7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Low for basic use: short prompts produce usable outputs immediately. Getting fine-grained control (exact timing, color grading, brand fidelity) requires more experimentation or finishing in an NLE."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0384qlmc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "l42d4ele",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "First render experience:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "xed6k00v",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You can typically get a first draft in a few minutes; the interface nudges you toward templates, canvas editing (inpaint/expand/remove), and image-to-image tweaks, so first renders feel approachable rather than technical.\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
