          "_key": "1s3q9i4q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " node. Workflow example: concept → Dreamina draft → CapCut/NLE for finishing → publish. It’s perfect for rapid prototyping, social ads, moodboards, and creating rough cuts for client signoff. Limitations show up when you need broadcast masters, complex VFX, or precise color grading — those should move to a traditional editor after Dreamina gives you a head start."
