          "text": " I got a fast draft that matched mood and pacing. The cuts were energetic and the rough VO placement worked, though lip sync and exact phrasing needed manual VO import for polish. Render time: a few minutes for the first pass; one quick tweak and a re-render added ~3–5 minutes. "
