        {
          "_key": "tbhqyxff",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "“Use brand palette (#0D3B66 #FAF0CA #F4D35E), logo on lower right, 15s bumper.” "
        },
        {
          "_key": "mm7ztc2o",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What I expected:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "no5y6oh2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " color-matched graphics and logo placement. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2cw83e2w",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What happened:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "enwp4vht",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Dreamina accepted hex codes and applied a palette to titles and background elements. Uploading the logo and pinning it to the corner was straightforward; however, exact color fidelity and logo sharpness needed a re-import at higher resolution. Trimming and timing were easy in the template."
        },
        {
          "_key": "dmela231",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "yogijqsz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2sfzpsw7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Verdict:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "937eiopf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Handles brand basics well — great for quick bumpers and social intros, but final logo/vector polish belongs in proper design software.\nFor each test I noted: iterations were fast (minutes), generated footage is realistic enough for client review but not final delivery, audio handling is adequate for drafts (voiceover auto-place helps), and final finishing still benefits from an NLE."
        },
        {
          "_key": "78h81wun",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
