      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4lz0pil4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dreamina is an excellent ideation companion: it turns short prompts into polished drafts quickly, and the template-led approach is ideal for social-first workflows. If you need to iterate and test creative directions fast, Dreamina will save hours. If you need final, broadcast-quality deliverables, treat Dreamina as a powerful concepting tool and finish the deliverable in a dedicated editor. Final verdict: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "chx0pqed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Try Dreamina today if you want fast, usable drafts for social and client rounds — but plan on an NLE for final polish."
        },
        {
          "_key": "sf6aa4jd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " For those looking to go further, I'd also suggest exploring lovart ai. It's a fantastic platform that turns your text descriptions into stunning visuals with ease."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
